    <!-- ==============================================================
         HALAMAN 2: LANGKAH 1 - LOGIN ADMIN & TINJAUAN EKSEKUTIF DASHBOARD
         ============================================================== -->
    <div class="doc-sheet">
        <div class="kop-surat">
            <img src="/logo-bkn-asli.png" alt="Logo BKN" class="kop-logo">
            <div class="kop-text">
                <h2>BADAN KEPEGAWAIAN NEGARA</h2>
                <h3>KANTOR REGIONAL V JAKARTA</h3>
                <p>SOP Administrator • Langkah 1: Akses Login & Dashboard Eksekutif</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="chapter-header">
            <div class="chapter-title">
                <span>🔐</span> LANGKAH 1: Login Admin & Tinjau Metrik Dashboard
            </div>
            <span class="chapter-badge">Langkah Awal</span>
        </div>

        <div class="scenario-box">
            <strong>🎯 Skenario Anda sebagai Administrator:</strong>
            Anda mengawali jam kerja kedinasan dengan membuka sistem untuk memeriksa antrean permohonan lisensi daring
            yang diajukan divisi dan memantau ketersediaan ruang rapat kantor.
        </div>

        <!-- DIAGRAM ALUR ADMIN -->
        <div class="workflow-diagram">
            <div class="wf-node active">1. Login & Dashboard</div>
            <span class="wf-arrow">➔</span>
            <div class="wf-node">2. Manajemen User</div>
            <span class="wf-arrow">➔</span>
            <div class="wf-node">3. Approval Zoom</div>
            <span class="wf-arrow">➔</span>
            <div class="wf-node">4. Kelola Meeting</div>
            <span class="wf-arrow">➔</span>
            <div class="wf-node">5. Berita Acara</div>
            <span class="wf-arrow">➔</span>
            <div class="wf-node">6. Slido & AI</div>
        </div>

        <!-- SCREENSHOT MOCKUP 1: LOGIN & DASHBOARD EKSEKUTIF ADMIN -->
        <div class="ss-browser-frame">
            <div class="ss-browser-bar">
                <div class="ss-dots">
                    <span class="ss-dot r"></span>
                    <span class="ss-dot y"></span>
                    <span class="ss-dot g"></span>
                </div>
                <div class="ss-address-bar">https://meeting.bkn.go.id/dashboard (Hak Akses: Administrator)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="ss-viewport" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr; gap: 12px;">
                <!-- Sidebar Khusus Admin -->
                <div style="background: #0f172a; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px; color: white; position: relative;">
                    <span class="callout-badge" style="position: absolute; right: 6px; top: 6px;">1</span>
                    <div style="font-size: 8.5px; font-weight: 800; color: #f87171; margin-bottom: 6px;">MENU ADMIN:
                    </div>
                    <div style="font-size: 8px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px;">
                        <span style="background: #1e293b; padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 3px;">🏠 Dashboard</span>
                        <span style="background: #dc2626; padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 3px; font-weight: 700;">👥
                            Manajemen User</span>
                        <span style="background: #1e293b; padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 3px;">📋 Manajemen
                            Meeting</span>
                        <span style="background: #1e293b; padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 3px;">📹 Request Zoom</span>
                        <span style="background: #1e293b; padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 3px;">📊 App
                            Infografis</span>
                        <span style="background: #1e293b; padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 3px;">📖 Manual Book</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Konten Utama Dashboard -->
                <div
                    style="background: white; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px; position: relative;">
                    <span class="callout-badge" style="position: absolute; right: 8px; top: 8px;">2</span>
                    <div style="font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 6px;">Periksa 3
                        Kartu Metrik Prioritas:</div>

                    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 6px;">
                        <div
                            style="background: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius: 4px; padding: 5px; text-align: center;">
                            <div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: #1d4ed8;">12</div>
                            <div style="font-size: 7px; color: #475569;">Total Agenda</div>
                        </div>
                        <div
                            style="background: #fef2f2; border: 1.5px solid #ef4444; border-radius: 4px; padding: 5px; text-align: center;">
                            <div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: #dc2626;">3</div>
                            <div style="font-size: 7px; color: #dc2626; font-weight: 700;">Antrean Menunggu!</div>
                        </div>
                        <div
                            style="background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 4px; padding: 5px; text-align: center;">
                            <div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; color: #15803d;">8</div>
                            <div style="font-size: 7px; color: #475569;">Lisensi Terbit</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div style="font-size: 7.5px; color: #64748b;">
                        Jika kotak merah <em>"Antrean Menunggu"</em> menunjukkan angka > 0, segera buka menu
                        <strong>Request Zoom</strong> untuk memberikan persetujuan.
